Z||000000||Tigger||04-01-2001||03:00 PM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/tigfoolow.gif"> <P>Here she is, finally lowered!  For the drop I used Street Dreams 2" drop spindles up front combined with 2" drop springs from suspension techniques all around.  For the rear I cut out a 2" section out of the strut and re-welded it back together.<P>Still needs to go to the alignment shop but I'm still trying to figure out how I'm going to get it there.<P>More pictures to come soon!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||6
